{"t":"Powerful Strike","s":"powerful-strike-96aba","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Powerful_Strike_e32fff.png","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Powerful Strike</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Powerful Strike\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Powerful_Strike_e32fff.png\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Usage Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"prefix\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Prefix</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Powerful</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"effect\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Effect</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">raises critical hit damage by 40% and critical hit chance by 5%</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"name\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Cost</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">250,000 gp + Astral Sources</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"category\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Critical Hit</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"slots\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Slots</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Axes, Swords, Clubs, Wands, Rods, Bows, Crossbows</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">11.02.4128<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 6, 2016<br/>Winter Update 2016</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Imbuing\">Imbuing</a> <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-imbuement-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-imbuement-description\"><b>Powerful Strike</b> is an <a href=\"#/wiki/Imbuing\">imbuement</a> that can be applied to certain types of Swords, Clubs, Axes, Bows, Crossbows, Rods, and Wands. When applied, it raises critical hit damage by 40% and critical hit chance by 5%.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-imbuement-astral-sources\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Astral_Sources\">Astral Sources</span></h3>\n<p>When imbuing an item with Powerful Strike, the following items are expended:</p>\n<p>20× Protective Charm, 25× Sabretooth, 5× <a href=\"#/wiki/Vexclaw%20Talon\">Vexclaw Talon</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-imbuement-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>The ability to apply this imbuement can be obtained by finishing the <a href=\"#/quest/heart-of-destruction-quest\">Heart of Destruction Quest</a> or by finishing the <a href=\"#/quest/forgotten-knowledge-quest\">Forgotten Knowledge Quest</a>.\n</p><p><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Powerful Strike Scroll </i> </span><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Powerful Strike Scroll\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Powerful_Strike_Scroll_e73358.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-imbuement-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>On July 21, 2025, the Summer Update 2025 changed the chance from 10% to 5%, and additional damage from 50% to 40%, with the introduction of Weapon Proficiency.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Imbuements\">Related Imbuements</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Critical_Hit_Imbuements\">Critical Hit Imbuements</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Basic Strike</li><li>Intricate Strike</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["forgotten-knowledge-quest","heart-of-destruction-quest"]}